[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おーい、レスナー！\nレスナはいったい、どこまで行ったんじゃ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, Resna! Where the heck did you run off to?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鬼門、明けましておめでとー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon, Happy New Year!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ殿。明けましておめでとうござりまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina. Happy New Year to you as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、明けましておめでと！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Happy New Year!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "マルローネさんたちもいたんですね！\n皆さん、明けましておめでとうございます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're all here too! Happy New Year, everyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ殿は、何か探しているのですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you searching for something, Alvina?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。レスナを探してるんだけど、\nどこかで見なかった？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, I'm looking for Resna. Have you seen her anywhere?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ殿でござるか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, you say?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "拙者たちに挨拶した後、海岸のほうに向かわれましたぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After greeting us, she headed toward the beach."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "海岸か。ありがと！\u3000ところでみんな、美味しそうなの\n食べてるけど、なにそれ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The beach? Thanks! By the way, what's that delicious-looking thing you're all eating?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "餅という、新年の定番の料理らしいぞ。\nお前さんも１つどうだ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's called mochi—apparently a New Year's staple around here. Want to try one?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やった！\u3000ありがと……もぐ……んんっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sweet! Thanks... *munch*... Mmph!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ああっ。もっとよく噛んで飲み込まないと！\nアンペル、お茶！\u3000アルビーナ、お茶飲んで！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-wait! You need to chew it more thoroughly before swallowing! Empel, tea! Alvina, drink some tea!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "んぐっ……んんっ……ぷはぁーーっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*gulp*... *cough*... *gasp*!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だ、大丈夫でありますか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A-are you all right?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こ、こいつは、慣れないと危険な食べ物っすね！\n美味しいけど！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Th-this stuff is dangerous if you're not used to it! Tasty, though!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私も最初は面食らったぞ。\n永遠も鬼門も、なぜ最初に注意をしない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was caught off guard at first too. Towa, Kimon, why didn't either of you warn her?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いやいや、普通そんなに勢いよく頬張ったり\n飲み込んだりするとは思わないよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, how was I supposed to know she'd shove it in her mouth and swallow it that fast?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは！\u3000お餅って面白いわよねぇ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha! Mochi is pretty funny, isn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ、笑いごとじゃないっすよ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-it's not funny..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、これも旅の醍醐味か！\nこの不思議な食感、癖になりそう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I guess this is all part of the travel experience! This weird texture is kinda addictive."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（やっぱり、海の外には、本や話だけじゃ\n\u3000分からない、面白いものがたくさんあるね！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Just like I thought—there's so much interesting stuff out here that you can't learn from books or stories alone!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お餅といえば、さっきレスナから調味料を\nもらったのよ。お餅にかけると美味しいって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Speaking of mochi, Resna gave me some seasoning earlier. She said it's delicious on mochi."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "確か、錬金術で作ったと言ってたな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She mentioned making it with alchemy, if I recall."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんなでかけて食べてみましょうよ！\nアルビーナも試してみるでしょ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's all try it together! You'll give it a shot too, right, Alvina?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今年はお守りじゃなくて、これを配ってるのかしらね。\nあむ……ん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wonder if she's handing this out instead of charms this year. *munch*... Hm?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん～～～っ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mmmph?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "マ、マルローネさん、大丈夫！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "M-Marie, are you okay?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "マルローネ殿、お茶ですぞ！\u3000口を濯ぎなされ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie, here's some tea! Rinse your mouth!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "蛇神の意思に憑かれたとはいえ、レスナが\n害意のあるものを仕込むはずはないが、念のためだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even if she's under the serpent god's influence, Resna wouldn't intentionally harm anyone, but better safe than sorry."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ、は～～！\u3000びっくりしたわ～！\nもう、いきなり口が痺れちゃって！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*gasp*! That startled me! My mouth went completely numb all of a sudden!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナがイタズラを仕込んだっすね……\nこのままじゃ、誰か犠牲者が出るかも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So Resna did play a prank... At this rate, someone else might fall victim too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなに深刻な顔するほどじゃないわよ。\nピリッとした程度だから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's not that serious! It was just a little tingly!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、それでも君は不用心だと思うぞ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "S-still, you were way too careless!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "永遠の言う通りだな。\nマルローネ、お前さんはそそっかしすぎる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa's right. You're far too reckless, Marlone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むぅ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははは……それにしても、皆さん仲良しですね。\n御前試合で親しくなったっすか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha... You all get along really well though. Did you become friends during the trial matches?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "以前クロガネ島で、共に強い魔物と戦いました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We fought a powerful monster together on Kurogane Island previously."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこでなんとなく馬が合ってね。リラが冷静沈着に\n見えて、餅に引っかかりそうだなーとかもね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We just kinda hit it off there. Like how Lila looks calm and collected, but she'd probably fall for the mochi trick too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "永遠。お前はいつも一言余計だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa. You always say one thing too many."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふっ！\u3000思わぬ繋がりがあったんですねー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe! That's a connection I didn't expect!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よっし。アタシはレスナを捕まえてきますわ。\n他でもなにしでかしてるか分からんし！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All right, I'm gonna go track down Resna. Who knows what else she's gotten up to!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それとアタシ、「福迎え」に出場するっす。\n応援よろしくね～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, and I'm entering the Blessing Race. Wish me luck!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]